        rdfs:comment "[BLAKE3](https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3-specs/blob/master/blake3.pdf)"@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/crystalsDilithium> a owl:NamedIndividual,
            ns1:HashAlgorithm ;
